" de sonido)"

#: xcontrol/audio_page.py:40
msgid "Prefer it whenever it's connected"
msgstr "Preferirlo siempre que esté conectado"

#: xcontrol/audio_page.py:45
msgid ""
"Hidden devices disappear from every program. Changes restart WirePlumber, "
"which takes a second."
