#: xcontrol/audio_page.py:98
msgid "Follow what's playing (44.1 kHz music plays at 44.1 kHz, unconverted)"
msgstr ""
"Seguir lo que se reproduce (la música a 44,1 kHz suena a 44,1 kHz, sin "
"convertir)"

#: xcontrol/audio_page.py:105
msgid "Buffer size"
msgstr "Tamaño del búfer"

#: xcontrol/audio_page.py:107
msgid ""
"Keep all outputs awake (no pops, no cut-off first second; HDMI and USB DACs)"
msgstr ""
"Mantener todas las salidas activas (sin chasquidos ni primer segundo "
"cortado; HDMI y DAC USB)"

#: xcontrol/audio_page.py:111
msgid ""
"Sample rate and buffer size change right away; the rest restarts "
